return ['domain'=>'page-builder-sandwich','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'page-builder-sandwich','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-28T08:18:44+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-28T08:18:44+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Page Builder Sandwich','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich','The foundation release of the rebuilt Page Builder Sandwich: a settings and About screen, a footprint-free front-end output layer, and one sample content block.'=>'Fitowar farko ta sabon Page Builder Sandwich da aka sake ginawa: saituna da allon Game da Mu, yadidin fitarwa na gaba mai tsabta ba tare da alamar SEO ba, da kuma tubalin abun ciki guda daya.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'Masu ba da sabis na AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Masu aikata ChatGPT. Kwararren mai yin komai sosai.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Masu ƙirƙirar Claude. Suna da ƙarfi wajen rubutawa kuma suna da hankali wajen yin la\'akari.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Samfurin Gemini na Google. Masu sauri da rahusa.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Wani kamfanin AI na Turai mai sauri da arha samfura.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Samfuran mai sauƙi waɗanda ke da kyau wajen rubutu da lissafi.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Maɓalli guda ɗaya don samfuran daga masu samarwa daban-daban.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Duk wani sabis da ke aiki kamar API na OpenAI, gami da samfurin da ke aiki akan kwamfutarka ko uwar garken ka.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Gabaɗaya (ana amfani da shi lokacin da babu takamaiman abin da aka saita)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Rubuta da sake rubutawa','Translation'=>'Fassara','Code and CSS'=>'Lamba da CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin shiga wannan shafin ba.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Wadannan saitunan suna da alaƙa da kowane plugin da ke amfani da su: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'An ɓoye Maɓallanka a cikin bayanan wannan shafin kuma ana aika su ne kawai zuwa ga mai ba da sabis da kuka zaɓa - ba za a taba aika su gare mu ba.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Mataki na 1 na 2: zabi mai ba da sabis na AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Kuna kawo naku key, don haka kuna biyan mai ba da sabis ɗin kai tsaye don abin da kuka yi amfani da shi. Ba ku da tabbas? Ko wanne daga cikin waɗannan yana aiki sosai; za ku iya ƙara ƙarin daga baya.','Next'=>'Na gaba','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Mataki na 2 na 2: haɗa %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗin da ke da jituwa da OpenAI, wanda ya ƙare da /v1. Ana buƙatar maɓalli ne kawai idan sabis ɗin ya nemi ɗaya.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Buɗe %s sannan ka shiga (ko ka ƙirƙiri sabon ajiya kyauta).','the %s API keys page'=>'shafin mabulsan API na %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ƙirƙiri sabuwar maɓalli sannan ka kwafi ita.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Li manna shi a kasa sannan a danna "Ajiye a gwada". Muna tura karamin buƙatu guda ɗaya don bincika yana aiki.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Yawancin masu ba da sabis suna buƙatar ɗan kuɗi a cikin asusun kafin maɓalli ya yi aiki: %s.','add credit'=>'ƙara bashi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Zabi wani mai ba da sabis daban','Address'=>'Adireshin','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Aɓuƙan da aka ajiye yana ƙarewa a …%s — liƙa sabo don maye gurbin sa','Key (optional)'=>'Maɓalli (zaɓi)','API key'=>'Maɓallin API','Save and test'=>'Ajiye kuma a gwada','Providers'=>'Masu bada sabis','Provider'=>'Mai ba da sabis','Status'=>'Matsayi','Key'=>'Maɓalli','Get a key'=>'Samu maɓalli','Test'=>'Gwaji','Remove'=>'Cire','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Wanda wani sabon sigar plugin ya adana: sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma a sake shigar da mabudin.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin da aka ajiye ba kuma (an canza maɓallin tsaro na shafin). Shigar da shi sake.','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'An haɗa — gwajin ƙarshe ya yi nasara %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Gwajin da ya gabata ya gaza: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'An haɗa — ba a gwada ba tukuna','Which model to use'=>'Wane model za a yi amfani da shi','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ yana nuna shawararmu don wannan aikin. Jerin ya ƙunshi kowane samfurin da maɓallinku zai iya amfani da shi, wanda aka karanta kai tsaye daga mai bada sabis ɗin.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— An ba da shawarar ga mai bada sabis —','Save models'=>'Ajiye samfura','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sabunta jerin samfuran daga masu samarwa','Images'=>'Hotuna','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Haɗa OpenAI ko Google Gemini don yin hotuna.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin hoto na farko na mai ba da sabis da aka haɗa —','best quality'=>'mafi kyau','lowest cost'=>'mafi ƙarancin farashi','fastest'=>'mafi sauri','Add a model yourself'=>'Ƙara samfuri da kanka','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'An fitar da sabon samfuri a yau? Manna daidai sunansa don amfani da shi nan take.','Model name'=>'Sunan samfurin','Add model'=>'Ƙara samfurin','Recommended models list'=>'Jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Ba a iya tabbatar da jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar ba, don haka ba a nuna shawarwari ba. Sake shigar da plugin ɗin, ko kuma kunna sabuntawa na yau da kullum a ƙasa.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Jerin da ake amfani da shi an wallafa shi ne a ranar %s. Kowane sabuntawar kari (plugin) yana kawo sabon guda ɗaya.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Hakanan a bincika Zinn Digital® sau ɗaya a rana don samun sabon jerin sunaye.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ana aika da sauƙaƙe buƙatar saukarwa kawai: babu makulli, babu adireshin shafin, babu wani abu game da abun ciki naka. An sanya hannu kan jerin, kuma an yi watsi da jerin da ya kasa binciken sa hannu.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'An bincika karshe a %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Ajiye, sannan a duba yanzu idan an kunna','a newer list was installed'=>'an shigar da sabon jerin sunaye','already up to date'=>'rigakafi da sabuntawa','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'zazzakunan sun gaza wuce gwajin sa hannu kuma an yi watsi da su','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Ba za a iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba; jerin na yanzu zai ci gaba da amfani','turned off'=>'an kashe','Open'=>'Buɗe','Check their status page'=>'Bincika shafin yanayin su','Open your billing page'=>'Buɗe shafin kuɗi naka','Open your API keys page'=>'Buɗe shafin maɓallan API naka','Open the AI settings'=>'Buɗe saitunan AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin yin hakan ba.','Unknown provider.'=>'Ba a san mai ba da sabis ba.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗinku, alal misali http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Wannan ba ya yi kama da maɓallin API ba. Sake kwafin sa, ba tare da guraben sarari ba.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Da farko a liƙa maɓallin API ɗinka.','Key removed.'=>'An cire maɓallin.','Models saved.'=>'An adana samfuran.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Shigar dainiyar sunan samfurin, misali yadda takardun bayanin mai ba da sabis suka rubuta shi.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'An ƙara %s. Zaɓi shi a ƙarƙashin "Wane samfuri za a yi amfani da shi".','Model removed.'=>'An cire samfurin.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'An kashe sabuntawa kullum. Ana amfani da jerin da ya zo tare da plugin din.','Checked: %s.'=>'An Duba: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'An sabunta jerin samfuran.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Wani sabon sigar na ɗaya daga cikin plugins ɗinka ya adana maɓallin AI ɗinka. Sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma ka sake shigar da maɓallin a cikin saitunan AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin AI ɗinka da aka ajiyage ba (maɓallan tsaron rukunin yanar gizon sun canza). Sake shigar da shi a cikin saitunan AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a saita AI ba tukuna. Ƙara maɓalli don mai ba da AI a cikin saitunan AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a zaɓi samfurin ba don wannan aikin. Zaɓi ɗaya a cikin saitunan AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba a goyi bayansa da wannan sigar ta plugin ba.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a haɗa wani mai samar da AI da zai iya ƙirƙirar hotuna ba. Ƙara maɓalli na OpenAI ko Google Gemini a cikin saitunan AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba zai iya yin hotuna ba. Zaɓi OpenAI ko Google Gemini don hotuna a cikin saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Ba za a iya amfani da mabudin AI naka tare da wani samfurin hoto ba. Duba izinin mabudin tare da mai ba da sabis din, ko zaɓi wani mai ba da sabis din don hotuna.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya tuntuɓar sabis ɗin AI naka ba. Bincika cewa yana aiki kuma ana iya isa ga adireshinsa daga sabar gidan yanar gizon ku (sabis da ke kan kwamfutarka ba zai iya isa ba daga shafin da aka karɓa).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya isa ga %s ba. Duba shafin matsayinsu; idan suna aiki, mai masaukin ku na iya toshe haɗin da ke fita, ko kuma adireshin ba daidai bane.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s ya ce asusunka ba shi da kuɗi ko kuma adadin da ya rage. Ƙara kuɗi ko ɗaga iyakar a cikin asusunka tare da su, sannan a sake gwadawa.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s bai karɓi makullin ku ba. Wataƙila an rubuta shi ba daidai ba, an soke shi ko kuma ya ƙare. Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli sannan ka manna shi a nan.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s ya ki amincewa da wannan buƙatar don maɓallinka. Wataƙila maɓallin ba shi da damar shiga wannan samfurin ko fasalin, ko kuma asusunka yana buƙatar tabbatarwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Samfurin "%1$s" ba ya samuwa daga %2$s don maɓallin ku. Zaɓi wani samfuri a cikin saitunan AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Tsarin ku na %2$s bai haɗa da samfurin "%1$s" ba. Zaɓi wani samfurin a cikin saitunan AI, ko haɓaka tsarin ku tare da su.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s tana iyakance saurin da makullin ku ke iya aika buƙatu. Jira minti ɗaya kuma sake gwadawa, ko ku ɗaga iyakacin ƙimar ku tare da su.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s yana fuskantar matsaloli a halin yanzu (akwai katsewa ko kuma cunkoso a gefensu). Babu wani abu da ba daidai ba tare da saitunanka. Gwada sake nan ba da dadewa ba.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Om karakteristik AI ta gaza saboda dalilin da ba za mu iya gane shi ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ta ci gaba da faruwa, tuntuɓi sashen goyon baya tare da cikakkun bayanan da ke ƙasa.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na AI ya ba da amsa a wata sifa da wannan plugin ɗin bai iya karantawa ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ya ci gaba da faruwa, zaɓi wani samfurin ko tuntuɓi goyon baya.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Keɓaɓɓe (Mai jituwa da OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Farko a adana maɓalli don wannan mai ba da sabis.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Maɓallin ku yana aiki, amma mai ba da sabis ɗin bai lissafa wani samfurin rubutu don shi ba. Ƙara wani samfurin da kanka a ƙasa.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'An haɗa. %1$s ya/ta amsa ta amfani da %2$s. Siffofin AI ɗinka suna shirye don amfani.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Ba a ba matsayin mai amfani da ku izinin amfani da AI a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Tambayi mai gudanarwa.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar kasafin kuɗinsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara shi a cikin saitunan AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar buƙatunsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara ta a cikin saitunan AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Amfani da kuma tsada','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Rubutun shiga, iyakoki da izinin matsayi suna aiki kan AI da ake amfani da ita ta: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kudin sun kusa zama daidai, an lissafa su ne daga farashin da aka buga; samfurin da babu wani sanannen farashi yana da darajar sifili.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Wannan wata: buƙatun %1$s, kimanin %2$s.','When'=>'Lokacin da','Who'=>'Waye','Used for'=>'A yi amfani da shi don','Model'=>'Samfurin','Tokens in / out'=>'Alamar shiga / fita','About'=>'Game da Mu','Result'=>'Sakamako','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Ba a yi roƙon AI ko ɗaya ba tuƙuna.','Done'=>'An gama','Limits and permissions'=>'Iyakoki da izini','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Iyakar kashe kuɗi ta wata-wata (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Bar shi babu komai don babu iyaka. AI zai tsaya na sauran watan da zarar kudin da aka kiyasta sun kai wurin.','Monthly request limit'=>'Iyakokin buƙatu na kowane wata','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Bar shi a ba komai don babu iyaka.','Who may use AI'=>'Wane ne zai iya amfani da AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Cirewa ba tare da zabi ba don barin kowa wanda zai iya amfani da fasalullukan plugin ɗin ya yi amfani da AI. Masu gudanarwa za su iya amfani da shi kowane lokaci.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Ajiye iyakoki da izini','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'An adadin da izini an adana.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Kuskuren tsaro, don Allah sake loda shafin kuma a sake gwadawa.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Saitunan wasiƙar labarai sun ɓace. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai gudanarwa.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Saitunan jaridar labarai ba su da inganci. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai kula da tsarin.','Invalid email address.'=>'Anwani ta imel ba daidai ba ce.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kokarin da yawa. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan \'yan mintoci kaɗan.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Wani abu ya lalace. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai gudanarwa.','Map'=>'Taswira','Background video'=>'Bidiyon bango','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: Fayilolin rubutu %2$d da aka adana, takardar salo %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'Ba a adana wannan iyalin ba.','Removed.'=>'An cire.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Wannan ba ingantaccen sunan iyalin rubutu ba ne.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts bai dawo da wannan iyalin ba. Duba sunan sannan a sake gwadawa.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Ba a iya sauke ko adana fayilolin rubutun ba. Tabbatar cewa foldar loda tana da ikon rubutawa.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Ba a iya adana takardar salon haruffa (font stylesheet) ba. Duba ko babban fayil din loda abubuwa (uploads folder) yana da ikon karɓar rubutu.','Dismiss this notice'=>'Kora da wannan sanarwa','Design'=>'Tsara Design','Content'=>'Abun ciki','Media'=>'Watsa labarai','Marketing'=>'Tallace-tallace','Site'=>'Shafi\'i','Data'=>'Bayanan','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Babu rubutun allo na mai gudanarwa a cikin wannan kwafin na plugin ɗin. Sake shigar da shi daga fakitin da aka fitar.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Wannan allon yana buƙatar JavaScript.','Languages'=>'Harsuna','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Dole ne prefix ya zama haruffa ƙanana 1 zuwa 8 ko lambobi, ya kafa da harshe, kuma kada ya sanya wa plugin suna.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin gyara wannan abu ba.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Ba a ba ka izinin yin wannan ba.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'An kashe yanayin tsaro domin baya dace da shigarka ta gaba. Sake loda shafin.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Mai gudanarwa ne kawai zai iya amfani da yanayin aminci.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Yanayin aminci yana buƙatar shiga ta na\'urar bincike ta al\'ada.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Ba a iya saita yanayin aminci ba.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Yanayin tsaro yana buƙatar damar rubutawa zuwa ga babban fayil na wp-content/mu-plugins.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta wa zuwa cikin kundin adireshi na wp-content/mu-plugins ba a yanayin kariya (Safe mode).','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Wannan shafin babu shi, ko kuma an goge shi.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin gyara wannan abu a cikin Sandwich Studio ba.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Ba a gina Sandwich Studio ba. Sake shigar da plugin ɗin.','Add title'=>'Ƙara take','Type / to choose a block'=>'Rubuta / don zaɓar wani b da ke rufe','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Ana loda Sandwich Studio...','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio na buƙatar JavaScript. Yi amfani da madadin edita na al\'ada maimakon haka.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'Gyara “%s” tare da Sandwich Studio','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Gyara tare da Sandwich Studio','Blank canvas'=>'Fanko mara komai','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Dole fadin kwamfutar hannu ya zama lambar pixel duka daga 480 zuwa 2560.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Faɗin wayar hannu dole ne ya zama lambar pixel ta duka, aƙalla 240 kuma ta fi faɗin kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka ƙankanta.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kowane ɓangaren hutu na musamman yana buƙatar nasa ID: haruffa ƙanana 2 zuwa 12 ko lambobi, waɗanda suka fara da harafi.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Wani kebantaccen ma\'aunin karyewa yana aiki ne ko dai har zuwa faɗi (daga pixels 200 zuwa 4000) ko kuma daga faɗi (daga pixels 200 zuwa 6000), ba duka biyun ba.','Tablet'=>'Kwanon kwamfuta','Mobile'=>'Wayar hannു','Site design'=>'Tsarin shafin','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Launi, haruffa da salo waɗanda kowane shafi na shafin da jigon ku suke raba.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'Ba a iya buɗe salon gama gari na shafin ba.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Waccan font ba ɗaya ba ne daga cikin font ɗin da ke kan rukunin yanar gizon.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Duk launi yana buƙatar suna na musamman da aka yi da ƙananan haruffa, lambobi, da kuma alamar raba kalma.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Launin "%s" ba ingantaccen launin CSS ba ne.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Duk wani font yana buƙatar suna na musamman da aka yi da ƙananan baƙaƙe, lambobi, da kuma alamar raba kalma (hyphen).','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'Jerin font na "%s" na iya ƙunsar sunayen font kawai, alamomin ambato, waƙafi da gurabaru.','Uploaded icons'=>'Hotunan da aka loda','Icon'=>'Alama','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Wannan fayil din ba alamar SVG ba ce da za mu iya amfani da ita. Wataƙila ya lalace, ko kuma ya ƙunshi abubuwan da aka cire don dalilan tsaro (rubutun shirin kwamfuta, hanyoyin haɗi, hotunan da aka saka ko rubutu).','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'Ba a iya goge alamar ba.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'wani mabudin lasisi','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Har yanzu ba a haɗa mai amfani da lasisin ba, wanda hakan ke da muhimmanci don hana kunna shi ta hanyar da ba a ba da izini ba. Don sanya lasisin ga mai amfani da ku, kun yarda ku raba cikakken suna da adireshin imel na mai amfani da ku na WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'shafukan da aka ambata a sama','Account'=>'Asusun ajiya','Account Details'=>'Bayanin Asusun','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Ana jiran a kunna asusun. Da fatan za a duba imel ɗinku sannan a danna mahadar don kunna asusunku sannan a sake gabatar da fom ɗin abokin tarayya.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Kuna son haɗa %1$s cikin %2$s?','Actions'=>'Ayyuka','Activate'=>'Kunna','Activate Free Version'=>'Kunna Kyauta Na Kyauta','Activate License'=>'Kunna Lasisi','activate a license here'=>'kun kunna lasisi anan','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Da fat za a shigar da maɓallin lasisin da ka karɓa a imel ɗin da aka tura nan da nan bayan siyan:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Kunna lasisi a duk shafukan da ke cikin hanyar sadarwa.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Kunna lasisi a duk shafukan da ke jiran aiki.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'An riga an shigar da sigar biyan kuɗi ta %1$s. Da fatan za a kunna shi don fara amfani da fasalulluka na %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'An riga an shigar da sigar biyan kuɗi ta %1$s. Da fatan za a je zuwa %2$s domin kunna ta kuma fara amfana daga fasalulluka na %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Kunna wannan ƙari','Activate %s'=>'Kunna %s','Activate %s features'=>'Kunna fasalolin %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Kammala Kunna "%s" Yanzu','Activate %s Plan'=>'Kunna Tsarin %s','Activated'=>'An kunna','Activating'=>'Ana kunnawa','Activating license'=>'Ana kunna lasisi','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'An kunna asusun ku cikin nasara tare da tsarin %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Mai aiki','Add another domain'=>'Ƙara wani yanki daban','Add-Ons'=>'Karinan Kaya','Add Ons for %s'=>'Karinan Aiki na %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Mun kasa lodi jerin abubuwan da za a iya ƙarawa. Wataƙila matsala ce daga ɓangarenmu, da fatan za a gwada dawowa bayan ƴan mintuna kaɗan.','Add-On'=>'Ƙari','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s wani ƙari ne mai tsada kaɗai. Dole ne ka fara siyan lasisi kafin ka kunna manajan.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'An nasara wajen siyan %s Add-on.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'An inganta tsarin Karin %s ɗinka da nasara.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'An soke gwajin kyauta na %s cikin nasara. Tunda ƙarin yana da alaƙa ne kawai da premium an kashe shi ta atomatik. Idan kana son amfani da shi a nan gaba, dole ne ka sayi lasisi.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s ba zai iya gudana ba ba tare da fasahar ba.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'Ba za a iya sarrafa %1$s ba sai da %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Ina sanar da ku cewa ana jawo bayanin abubuwan ƙari na %s daga wani sabar waje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Ƙarin kayan aiki na module %s','Address Line %d'=>'Lambar Adireshin %d','Affiliate'=>'Abokin hulda','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Saboda keta sharuddan abokan hulwarmu, mun yanke shawarar dakatar da asusun abokin hulwarku na wani dan lokaci. Idan kana da wata tambaya, da fatan za a tuntuɓi goyon baya.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'An dakatar da asusun abokin tarayyarka na ɗan lokaci.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'An amince da aikace-aikacen abokin hulɗarka na %1$s! Shiga yankin abokin hulɗarka a: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Na gode da neman shiga cikin shirinmu na abokan hulɗa, abin takaici, mun yanke shawarar kin amince da roƙonku a wannan lokacin. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan kwanaki 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Na gode da neman shiga cikin shirinmu na abokan hulɗa, za mu duba bayanan ku a cikin kwanaki 14 masu zuwa kuma za mu tuntube ku da ƙarin bayani.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s binciken cookie bayan ziyarar farko don haɓaka damar samun kuɗi.','Affiliation'=>'Hadin gwiwa','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Da zarar lasisinku ya ƙare, zaku iya ci gaba da amfani da sigar Kyauta amma BA za ku sami damar amfani da abubuwan %s ba.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Da zarar lasisinku ya ƙare, ba za ku ƙara iya amfani da %s ba, sai dai idan kun sake kunna shi da ingantaccen lasisin farko.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Kuna iya ci gaba da jin daɗin duk abubuwan da ke cikin %1$s amma ba za ku sami damar samun sabunta tsaro da abubuwa na %2$s ba, ko tallafi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Na gode da haɓakawa.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bayan kyautarka ta %1$s, biya kaɗan kamar %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Yardewa & Kunna Lasisi','I Agree - Change User'=>'Na Yarda - Canza Mai Amfani','All Requests'=>'Dukkan Buƙatun','All Types'=>'Duk Nau\'uka','allow'=>'bada dama','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Kun riga kun yarda da bin diddigin amfani da mu, wanda ke taimaka mana mu ci gaba da inganta %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Kun riga kun shiga cikin tsarin bin diddigin amfani da mu, wanda ke taimaka mana ci gaba da inganta su.','Amount'=>'Adadi','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Na shekara-shekara','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kullum shekara','Anonymous feedback'=>'Ra\'ayin da ba a san wanda ya bayar ba','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Yi amfani da shi a duk shafukan da ke cikin hanyar sadarwa.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Aiwatar da shi a kan duk shafukan da ke jiran aiki.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Yi amfani don zama abokin haɗin gwiwa','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Amince & Fara Gwaji','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Da fatan za a gaya mana dalili domin mu inganta.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel da ka yi amfani da shi don haɓakawa a ƙasa kuma za mu sake turo maka da maɓallin lasisin.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Shigar da adreshin imel ɗin da kuka yi amfani da shi lokacin siye kuma za mu sake tura muku maɓallin lasisi.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Haɗa tare da asusun mai mallakar lasisin.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Marubuci','Invalid module ID.'=>'An ingantaccen ID na samfuri.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Ba ku da ingantacciyar lasifikar shiga zuwa sigar premium.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Shigarwa ta atomatik tana aiki ne kawai ga masu amfani da suka yi rajista.','Premium version already active.'=>'An riga an kunna sigar Premium.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'An riga an shigar da ingantacciyar sigar ƙarin fasalin.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Kayyade shine "Serviceware" wanda ke nufin bazu da sigar lambar kuɗi ta musamman ba.','Automatic Installation'=>'Shigarwa ta Kanta','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Kasuwa ta atomatik a cikin:','Average Rating'=>'Matsakaicin Ƙimar','Awesome'=>'Mai ban mamaki','based on %s'=>'dangane da %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Zama abokin hulɗa','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Kuna son %s? Ku zama jakadanmu kuma ku sami kuɗi ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Sannu, ka san cewa %1$s yana da shirin abokan hulɗa? Idan kana son %2$s za ka iya zama jakadanmu kuma ka sami ɗan kuɗi!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Mafi kyau','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Sabuntawa zuwa sigar Beta zata maye gurbin wacce ka saka ta %s da sabon sigar Beta - yi amfani da shi da hankali, kuma kada a yi amfani da shi a kan rukunin yanar gizo na aiki. An riga an gargade ka.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'An caji %s','Billing'=>'Biya','Billing & Invoices'=>'Lissafin Kuɗi da Daftari','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'An hana','Blocking'=>'Ana rufewa','Blog ID'=>'Lambar Shafi na Yanar Gizo','Body'=>'Jiki','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Ee - adiresosan biyu nawa ne','Bundle'=>'Kunjiya','Bundle Plan'=>'Tsarin Kunshin','Business name'=>'Sunan kasuwanci','Buy license'=>'Sayari da lasisi','Buy a license now'=>'Sayi lasisi yanzu','Cancel'=>'Soke','Cancel Installation'=>'Soke Shigarwa','Cancel Subscription'=>'Soke Biyan Kuɗi','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Idan ba kwa shirin amfani da wannan %1$s a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon (ko wani rukunin yanar gizon ba) - kuna son soke %2$s ma?','Cancel Trial'=>'Soke Gwaji','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Soke gwaji zai hana shiga zuwa duk wasu abubuwa na musamman nan take. Kuna da tabbas?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Soke %s & Ci gaba','Cancelled'=>'An soke','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Ana soke biyan kuɗi','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ba za a iya samun mabudin lasisin ka ba?','Change License'=>'Canjin Lasisi','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'An aikohaka na tabbatarwa zuwa ga %s. Dole ne ka tabbatar da sabuntawa a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa. Idan ba za ka iya samun imel din ba, don Allah ka dubi babban fayil din spam naka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'An tura imel na tabbatarwa zuwa %s. Mai imel din dole ne ya tabbatar da sabuntawa a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s shine sabon mai mallakar asusun.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Mun gode da tabbatar da canjin mallaka. An aika da imel zuwa %s don amincewa ta ƙarshe.','Change Ownership'=>'Canja Mallaka','Change Plan'=>'Canji Tsari','Change User'=>'Canja Mai Amfani','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Ta hanyar sauya mai amfani, kun yarda ku tura mallakar asusun zuwa ga:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Canjin tarihin kaya','Changing user, please wait'=>'Ana canza mai amfani, don Allah a jira','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Idan ba ka karɓi imel ɗin ba, gwada duba babban fayil ɗin da ba a buƙata ba ko bincika imel daga %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Biya kuɗi','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Zabi shafuka har zuwa %s domin kunna lasisin a kai.','City'=>'Gari','Clear API Cache'=>'Share Cache din API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Share Tsabtace Abubuwan Sabuntawa','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Danna nan','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Danna nan don amfani da plugin din ba tare da nuna suna ba','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Danna don ganin sharhi da suka bayar da ƙimar %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s shine adireshin imel na abokin ciniki na','Code'=>'Lambar sirri','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Kashi %s lokacin da wani abokin ciniki ya sayi sabon lasisi.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kamar yadda muke keɓe kwanaki 30 don yiwuwar mayar da kuɗi, muna biyan kwamitocin da suka wuce kwanaki 30 ne kawai.','Communication'=>'Sadarwa','Compatible up to'=>'Mai jituwa har zuwa','complete the opt-in'=>'cika rajista','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Taya murna','Never miss an important update'=>'Kada ka taba rasa muhimman sabuntawa','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Na gode da sabuntawa zuwa %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Yi rijista don karɓar sanarwar imel don sabunta tsaro da abubuwa, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu mahimman bayanan muhalli na WordPress. Wannan zai taimaka mana mu sanya %s ya fi dacewa da rukunin yanar gizon ku kuma ya fi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙatar ya yi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Zabi ka karɓi sanarwar imel don sabunta tsaro & fasali, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu basic WordPress environment info.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Idan ka tsallake wannan, babu damuwa! %1$s zai ci gaba da aiki sosai.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Mun gabatar da wannan zaɓi don kar ka taɓa rasa wani muhimmin sabuntawa kuma ka taimake mu mu sanya %s ya fi dacewa da shafin yanar gizon ku kuma ya fi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙatar ya yi.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Muna farin cikin gabatar da hadewar Freemius a matakin cibiyar sadarwa.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'A lokacin aiwatar da sabuntawa mun gano %s shafi/shafuka a cikin hanyar sadarwa wanda/wadanda har yanzu ke buƙatar kulawar ku.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Lokacin sabuntawa mun gano shafin/shafuka %d da ke jiran a kunna lasisi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Idan kana so ka yi amفani da %s a waɗannan shafuka, don Allah ka shigar da maɓallin lasisinka a ƙasa sannan ka danna maɓallin kunna.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'A madadin haka, za ka iya tsallake shi a yanzu ka kunna lasisin daga baya, a shafin Asusun da ke matakin cibiyar sadarwa na %s ɗinka.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Haɗe','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Da zarar ka gama, kashe %s sannan ka sake kunnawa.','Contact'=>'Tuntuɓi','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Don Allah sanar da mu idan kana son mu tuntube ka domin sabunta tsaro & siffofi, abubuwan ilmantarwa, da kuma tayi-tayi daga lokaci zuwa lokaci:','Contact Support'=>'Tuntuɓi Tallafi','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Mun ba da hakuri bisa rashin jin daɗin da aka samu kuma muna nan don taimaka muku idan kun ba mu dama.','Contact Us'=>'Tuntuɓe Mu','Please contact us here'=>'Don Allah tuntuɓe mu a nan','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Da fatan za a tuntuɓe mu tare da wannan saƙon:','Continue'=>'Ci gaba','Contributors'=>'Masu igo','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Ba a iya kunna %s ba.','Country'=>'Ƙasa','Cron Type'=>'Nau\'in Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Muna amfani da dakin karatu na PHP cURL don kiran API, wanda shahararren dakin karatu ne kuma yawanci ana shigar da shi kuma an kunna shi ta atomatik. Abin baƙin ciki shine, ba a kunna cURL ba (ko an kashe shi) a uwar garken ku.','data'=>'bayanai','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'An kunna yanayin matsala da nasara kuma za a kashe shi ta atomatik cikin mintuna 60. Haka kuma zaka iya kashe 