s expired. %1$sUpgrade now%2$s to continue using the %3$s without interruptions.'=>'Lasisin ku ya ƙare. %1$sHaɓaka yanzu%2$s don ci gaba da amfani da %3$s ba tare da katsewa ba.','Your license has expired. You can still continue using all the %s features, but you\'ll need to renew your license to continue getting updates and support.'=>'Lasisin ku ya ƙare. Har yanzu za ku iya ci gaba da amfani da duk abubuwan %s, amma kuna buƙatar sabunta lasisin ku don ci gaba da samun sabuntawa da goyon baya.','License ID'=>'Lambar Lasisi','License issues?'=>'Matsalolin lasisi?','Single Site License'=>'Lasisin Shaf Ɗaya','Unlimited Licenses'=>'Lasisi Mara iyaka','Up to %s Sites'=>'Har zuwa Shafuka %s','Is this your client\'s site? %s if you wish to hide sensitive info like your email, license key, prices, billing address & invoices from the WP Admin.'=>'Shin wannan shafin abokin cinikin ku ne? %s idan kuna son boye bayanai masu mahimmanci kamar imel ɗin ku, maɓallin lasisi, farashi, adireshin lissafi & da takardun shaida daga WP Admin.','Your %1$s license was flagged as white-labeled to hide sensitive information from the WP Admin (e.g. your email, license key, prices, billing address & invoices). If you ever wish to revert it back, you can easily do it through your %2$s. If this was a mistake you can also %3$s.'=>'An shaidar lasisin ka na %1$s a matsayin mai alamar fari don ɓoye mahimman bayanai daga WP Admin (misali imel ɗin ka, maɓallin lasisi, farashi, adireshin lissafi & da lissafin kuɗi). Idan a wani lokaci kuna son mayar da shi baya, zaka iya yin hakan ta hanyar %2$s. Idan wannan kuskure ne zaka iya kuma %3$s.','Lifetime'=>'Rayuwa','Load DB Option'=>'Loda Zaɓin DB','Localhost'=>'Localhost','Log'=>'Rikodin Ayyuka','Logger'=>'Mai shiga da rajista','Long-Term Duplicate'=>'Dogon Lokaci Mai Koma-baya','Message'=>'Saƙo','Method'=>'Hanyar','Migrate Options to Network'=>'Yi kaura zuwa ga Sadarwa','Migrate'=>'Yi ƙaura','Migrate License'=>'Canja Lasisi','Is %2$s the new home of %4$s?