erruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'%1$s sabuntawar tsaro & fasali ta atomatik da kuma ayyukan da ake biyan kuɗi za su ci gaba da aiki ba tare da katsewa ba har zuwa %2$s (ko lokacin da lasisin ku ya ƙare, duk wanda ya fara zuwa).','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s don samun damar shiga sabuntawar tsaro da fasali na sigar %2$s, da kuma goyon baya.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'An haifar da wani kuskure da ba a sani ba yayin kokarin saita yanayin beta na mai amfani.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'An bayyana wani kuskure da ba a sani ba yayin ƙoƙarin sauya yan-gizo (white-label) na lasisin.','Annual'=>'Na shekara-shekara','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Ta danna "Opt Out", %s ba zai ƙara iya ganin sunanka da imel ɗinka ba.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Ta hanyar danna "Opt Out", ba za a sake aika da bayanan bincike zuwa ga %s ba.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Ta hanyar cire haɗin gidan yanar gizon, an goge bayanan bincike da aka raba a baya game da %1$s kuma ba za su ƙara zama a bayyane ga %2$s ba.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Ta hanyar zaɓin fitowa daga raba wannan bayanin tare da uwar garken ɗaukakawa, dole ne ka bincika sabbin saki na %1$s kuma ka zazzage & shigar da su da hannu. Ba kawai matsala ba ce, amma rasa ɗaukakawa na iya sanya shafinka cikin haɗari kuma ya haifar da matsalolin dacewa marasa amfani, don haka muna matukar ba da shawarar kiyaye waɗannan mahimman izini.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Soke %1$s - Ban buƙatar ƙarin sabuntawar tsaro & fasali, ko goyon baya ga %2$s domin ba na shirin amfani da %3$s a kan wannan, ko wani rarshen intanet ba.','Cancel %s?'=>'Soke %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Ana soke %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Ana soke %s...','Click here'=>'Danna nan','Deactivating'=>'Ana kashewa','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Cire haɗin gidan yanar gizon zai cire %s na har abada daga asusun Dashboard na Mai Amfani.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Domin isar da sabuntawar tsaro da fasali ta atomatik, da kuma gudanar da lasisi da kariya, %s na buƙatar:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Don iskar da sabunta tsaro da abubuwa, da kuma sarrafa lasisi, %s yana buƙatar','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius injiniya ce ta lasisi da sabunta software','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Idan wannan kwafi ne na dogon lokaci, don kiyaye sabuntawa ta atomatik da fasali na biya bayan %1$s, da fatan za a %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Shin %2$s kwafi ne na %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Shiga Shirin Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Shiga shirin Beta','License'=>'Lasisi','License Key'=>'Mukullin Lasisi','License key'=>'Maɓullin lasisi','Monthly'=>'Kowane wata','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Sunaye, alamomi, juzu\'i, da ko a kunna ko a\'a','New Version Available'=>'Sabon Sigar Akwai','Optional'=>'Na Zabi','Plan'=>'Tsari','Products'=>'Kayayyaki','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Raba bayanai masu nuna matsala yana taimakawa wajen samar da ƙarin aiki wanda ya dace da gidan yanar gizon ku, guje wa rashin jituwar sigar WordPress ko PHP wanda zai iya lalata gidan yanar gizon, da gane waɗanne harsuna & yankuna ya kamata a fassara %s zuwa gare su kuma a daidaita su.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Don haka za ka iya sake amfani da lasisin lokacin da %s bai kuma zama mai aiki ba.','Subscription'=>'Biyan kuɗi','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'The %1$s za ta riƙa aika mahimman bayanai na lasisi lokaci-lokaci zuwa %2$s don bincika sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, da kuma tabbatar da ingancin lasisin ku.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Akwai %1$s na %2$s da ake da shi.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Don tabbatar da jituwa da kuma guje wa rikici tare da shigar da plugins da jigogi naka.','Trial'=>'Gwaji','View %s State'=>'Duba Matsayin %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Duba Babban Bayanin %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ee, %2$s kwafi ne na %4$s don dalilin gwaji, staging, ko haɓakawa.','You have a %s license.'=>'Kuna da lasisi %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Kun sayi lasisin %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Za ka karɓi imel ɗin tabbatarwa na %1$s a cikin akwatin saƙonka a %2$s. Da fatan za a tabbatar ka danna maɓallin da ke cikin wannan imel ɗin don %3$s.','days'=>'kwanaki','deactivating'=>'ana kashewa','hour'=>'awa','hours'=>'awaƙi','license'=>'lasisi','optional'=>'na zaɓi ba','products'=>'kayayyaki','skip'=>'tsallake','subscription'=>'biyan kuɗi','trial'=>'gwaji','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Kayayyaki','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ana kunnawa','as software licenseLicense'=>'Lasisi','close a windowDismiss'=>'Washe','close windowDismiss'=>'Kora da shi','like websitesSites'=>'Shafyuka','nounPricing'=>'Farashi','trial periodTrial'=>'Gwaji','verbOpt In'=>'Shiga Ciki','verbOpt Out'=>'Fice Daga','verbSkip'=>'Tsallake','verbUpgrade'=>'Haɓaka','x-ago%s ago'=>'tun %s da suka wuce','A migration step is running right now. Try again in a minute.'=>'Ana gudanar da wani matakin kaura a yanzu. Sake gwadawa bayan minti daya.','Dark mode'=>'Yanayin duhu','Thank you for subscribing!'=>'Na gode da yin rajista!','Something went wrong. Please contact the administrator.'=>'Wani abu ya tafi ba daidai ba. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai kula da tsarin.','Years'=>'Shekaru','Months'=>'Watanni','Weeks'=>'Makonni','Days'=>'Kwanaki','Hours'=>'Awanni','Minutes'=>'Minti','Seconds'=>'Dakiku','Go to slide %d'=>'Je zuwa zamewa ta %d','You\'re already subscribed to our newsletter'=>'Kun riga kun yi rajista ga jaridarmu','Email address is already subscribed.'=>'An riga an yi rijistar adireshin imel din.','MailPoet plugin not found. Please contact the admin.'=>'Ba a sami plugin din MailPoet ba. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai kula da tsarin.','Choose the brand fonts from the site\'s fonts.'=>'Zaɓi rubutun alamar kasuwanci daga rubutun shafin.','That font is no longer in the font library.'=>'Wancan font din ba ya cikin ɗakin karatu na font ɗin kuma.','That font has no files yet. Upload at least one.'=>'Waccan font ba ta da fayiloli tukuna. A loda aƙalla ɗaya.','An Adobe Fonts kit id is 5 to 12 letters and digits, as shown in your Adobe Fonts web project.'=>'An Adobe Fonts kit id yana da haruffa 5 zuwa 12 da lamba, kamar yadda aka nuna a cikin aikin gidan yanar gizonku na Adobe Fonts.','Adobe Fonts did not return that kit. Check the id, and that the web project is published.'=>'Adobe Fonts ba ta dawo da wannan kit din ba. Bincika id, kuma tabbatar cewa an buga aikin gidan yanar gizon.','That Adobe Fonts kit has no fonts in it.'=>'Wancan kit na Adobe Fonts ba shi da wani font a ciki.','Choose how the site picks its colour scheme.'=>'Zaɓi yadda shafin ke zaɓar tsarin launinsa.','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Matsayin duhu na "%s" ba ingantaccen launi na CSS ba ne.','This site has reached the maximum number of global classes.'=>'Wannan shafin ya isa matsakaicin adadin azuzuwan duniya.','Give the class a name.'=>'Ba wa aji suna.','%s (copy)'=>'%s (kwafi)','A class name must start with a letter and use only lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Dole sunan azuzu ya fara da haruffa kuma ya yi amfani da kananan haruffa kawai, lambobi da alamomin cirewa.','Another class already uses that name.'=>'Wani aji yana amfani da wannan sunan tuni.','That class no longer exists. Reload the list.'=>'Wannan ajin babu shi kuma. Sake loda jerin.','Extra small'=>'Madaidaici sosai','Small'=>'Karami','Medium'=>'Matsakaici','Large'=>'Babba','Extra large'=>'Babba sosai','Huge'=>'Mai girma','None'=>'Babu kowa','Round'=>'Zagaye','Each entry needs a unique short name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kowane shigarwa yana buƙatar ɗan gajeren suna na musamman da aka yi da ƙananan haruffa, lambobi, da alamar raga.','The value of "%s" is not a value this setting accepts.'=>'Darajar "%s" ba ta kasance darajar da wannan saitin ke karɓa ba.','We are doing some maintenance on this site. Please check back soon.'=>'Ana yin wasu gyare-gyare a kan wannan shafin. Da fatan za a sake dubawa nan ba da dadewa ba.','This site is launching soon.'=>'Wannan shafin zai fara aiki nan ba da jimawa ba.','Maintenance mode is on'=>'An kunna yanayin kulawa','Pre-launch mode is on'=>'An kunna yanayin kafin kaddamarwa','Network templates'=>'Samfuran sadarwa','That find-and-replace job no longer exists.'=>'Waccen da bincike da maye gurbin bata nan ba.','That step is not available for this job right now.'=>'Wannan matakin ba ya samuwa ga wannan aikin a yanzu.','Enter what to find.'=>'Shigar da abin da za a nema.','Colours must be hex codes such as #1a73e8 or #fff.'=>'Launi dole su zama lambobi na hex kamar #1a73e8 ko #fff.','The new link must be a full web address (https://…), a path starting with /, or an anchor starting with #.'=>'Sabon hanyar haɗin dole ne ya zama cikakken adireshin gidan yanar gizo (https://…), hanya ce da ta fara da /, ko kuma anga da ta fara da #.','Client review comments'=>'Sharhin bita na abokin ciniki','Write a comment first.'=>'Rubuta sharhi da farko.','Client'=>'Abokin ciniki','That comment no longer exists.'=>'Wannan sharhin babu shi kuma.','New review comment on “%s”'=>'Sabon sharhi kan “%s”','%1$s wrote:

%2$s

Open the page in the editor to answer or resolve it:
%3$s'=>'%1$s ya rubuta:

%2$s

Buɗe shafin a cikin mai gyara don amsawa ko magance shi:
%3$s','This review link is not valid any more. Ask for a new one.'=>'Wannan hanyar haɗin bita ba ta da inganci kuma. Ka nemi sabuwa.','Too many comments from this link in the last hour. Try again later.'=>'Sharhi da yawa daga wannan hanyar haɗin a cikin sa\'ar da ta gabata. Sake gwadawa daga baya.','Your role cannot create templates or patterns.'=>'Matsayin ka ba zai iya ƙirƙirar samfura ko tsari ba.','You can change the text and images on this page, but not its layout or design. Your change was not saved.'=>'Kuna iya canza rubutu da hotuna a kan wannan shafi, amma ba tsari ko zaninsa ba. Ba a adana sauyin ku ba.','Your role cannot change styles. Undo the style changes and save again.'=>'Matsayinka ba zai iya canza salo ba. Mayar da canjin salon kuma ka sake adanawa.','Your role cannot add or change custom code (custom CSS or HTML blocks). Undo those changes and save again.'=>'Matsayin ku ba zai iya ƙara ko canza lambar al\'ada ba (kebantaccen CSS ko tubalan HTML). Soke waɗannan sauye-sauyen kuma ajiye sake.','This is not an export file from this plugin.'=>'Wannan ba fayil din fitarwa ba ne daga wannan matosai.','This export file was made by a newer version of the plugin. Update the plugin on this site, then import it again.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin fitarwa an yi shi ne ta hanyar sabon sigar plugin ɗin. Sabunta plugin ɗin da ke kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon, sannan a sake shigo da shi.','The export file is damaged: its list of items is missing.'=>'Fayil ɗin da aka fitar ya lalace: jerin abubuwansa sun ɓace.','The export file is damaged or was edited after it was made (its checksum does not match). Export it again from the other site.'=>'Fayil din fitarwa ya lalace ko an gyara shi bayan an ƙirƙira shi (checksum ɗinsa bai yi daidai ba). Sake fitar da shi daga ɗayan rukunin yanar gizon.','“%s” was not imported: this site does not have that kind of item.'=>'Ba a shigo da "%s" ba: wannan shafin ba shi da irin wannan nau\'in abun.','“%s” was not imported: you are not allowed to create that kind of item.'=>'Ba a shigo da “%s” ba: ba ka da izinin ƙirƙirar irin wannan abu.','“%s” was not replaced: you are not allowed to edit the one on this site.'=>'Ba a Maye gurbin "%s" ba: ba ka da izinin gyara wanda ke kan wannan shafin.','“%1$s” was not imported: %2$s'=>'Ba a shigo da "%1$s" ba: %2$s','Settings were not imported: only an administrator can change them.'=>'Ba a shigo da saitunan ba: mai gudanarwa ne kawai zai iya canza su.','The image %1$s was not copied: %2$s'=>'Ba a kwafi hoton %1$s ba: %2$s','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Wanda Neil Lock, Babban Jami\'in Gudanarwa na Zinn Digital® Ltd ya gina','Version %s'=>'Sigar %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Shafin Yanar Gizo na Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Shafin yanar gizo na Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Duba shirin Pro da farashinsa','Front-end output'=>'Fitowar gaban shafin','Class name prefix'=>'Ratabayon sunan Class','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kowane sunan aji da filogin ke bugawa akan shafukanku yana farawa da wannan gaba, ta yadda shafukan ba za su bayyana wane filogin ne ya gina su ba. Haruffa kanana ko lambobi 1 zuwa 8, wadanda suka fara da harafi.','Save'=>'Ajiye','Beta updates'=>'Sabuntawar Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Wannan shafin yana karɓar nau\'ikan beta azaman sabuntawa.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Wannan shafin yana karɓar ingantattun sassa kawai.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Canza wannan a shafin Asusu','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Ana bayar da nau\'ikan Beta ga shigarwar Pro da ke da lasisi waɗanda ke haɗa da asusun su. Da zarar an haɗa, zaku iya shiga daga shafin Asusun.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'An adana wuraren tsayawa. Shafuka za su ɗauki sabbin faɗin a gaba na gaba da suka gani.','Breakpoints'=>'Abubuwan da aka tsara','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Salon da aka saita don Tablet suna aiki har zuwa faɗin tablet, kuma salon da aka saita don Wayar hannu har zuwa faɗin wayar hannu. Salon kwamfuta yana aiki a duk sauran wurare.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Kantin kwamfuta: har zuwa (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Wayar hannju: har zuwa (px)','Save breakpoints'=>'Ajiye wuraren tsayawa','Use the default widths'=>'Yi amfani da faɗin tsoho-da-aka-sanya','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'An dakatar da juya wannan post din kafin a gama, don haka an tsallake post din. Buɗe shi don juya shi, ko kuma ka sake juya shi daga nan.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Babu wani ajiyar baya na wannan wallafe-wallafen da za a dawo da shi.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana abin da aka canza ba.','Unknown error.'=>'Kuskure wanda ba a sani ba.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Ba a bincika wani tsohon abun ciki ba tukuna.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Maido da tsohon abun ciki: %1$d na %2$d posts.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Canza tsohuwar abun ciki: %1$d na posts %2$d.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'An gama sauyawa: %1$d an dawo da su, %2$d sun gaza.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Canjin ya kammala: %1$d an canza, %2$d ba su canza ba, %3$d sun gaza.','Legacy content'=>'Tsohon abun ciki','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'An canza shafukan da aka yi da tsofaffin sifofin Page Builder Sandwich zuwa blocks a bango. Ana yin madadin kowanne post a gaba, don haka ana iya mayar da kowanecanji zuwa yadda yake.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Har yanzu post %d yana dauke da tsohon abun ciki.' . "\0" . 'Mawallafan %d har yanzu suna ɗauke da tsohon abun ciki.','%d post has a backup.'=>'Post %d yana da ajiyar baya.' . "\0" . '%d posts suna da madadin ajiyar bayanai.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Ba a iya sarrafa rubutu %d ba' . "\0" . 'Ba a iya sarrafa wallafe-wallafen %d ba','Post %d'=>'Rubutu na %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'An fara sauyawa. Yana ci gaba a bango; za ku iya barin wannan shafin.','Convert legacy content'=>'Maida tsohon abun ciki sabon salo','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Sake dawo da kowane gidan yanar gizon da aka maida zuwa tsohuwar sigarsa? Canje-canjen da aka yi wa waɗannan gidajen yanar gizon tun lokacin da aka maida su za su ɓace.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'An fara sauyawa. Yana ci gaba a bango; zaku iya barin wannan shafin.','Undo all conversions'=>'Soke duk juyawar','Alert'=>'Sanarwa','Information'=>'Bayani','Success'=>'Nasara','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Ana sanar da gargaɗi da kurakurai ga masu amfani da mai karanta allo nan take; ana karanta sanarwar bayani da nasara idan sun gama abin da suke yi.','Show icon'=>'Nuna alamar icon','Visitors can close it'=>'Masu ziyara za su iya rufe shi','Title (optional)'=>'Take (zaɓi)','Write the message…'=>'Rubuta sako...','section — a thematic section'=>'sashe — sashe mai jigo daya','div — no meaning'=>'div — babu ma\'ana','header — introductory content'=>'kan gaba 