ten'=>'Saukaka','Colour dodge'=>'Firam ɗoji','Colour burn'=>'Kona mai konewa','Hard light'=>'Tsananin haske','Soft light'=>'Haske mai laushi','Difference'=>'Bambanci','Exclusion'=>'Babuwa','Hue'=>'Launi','Saturation'=>'Moraɗa','Luminosity'=>'Haske','Blend mode'=>'Hanyar gaurayawa','Blur (px)'=>'Burciwa (px)','Brightness (%)'=>'Haske (%)','Contrast (%)'=>'Saban (%)','Greyscale (%)'=>'Launin toka (%)','Hue rotation (degrees)'=>'Juuyawar launuka (digiri)','Saturation (%)'=>'Cikewa (%)','Sepia (%)'=>'Sepia (%)','Drop shadow'=>'Inuwa ta baya','Across (px)'=>'Akwai (px)','Down (px)'=>'Kasa (px)','Softness (px)'=>'Laushi (px)','Shadow colour'=>'Launin Inuwa','Remove drop shadow'=>'Cire inuwar faduwa','Applies on every screen size.'=>'Ana amfani da shi a kowane girman allo.','Applies to the screen size chosen in the design panel.'=>'Yana shafa girman allon da aka zaɓa a cikin bangaren zane.','Background gradient'=>'Launin bango mai ɗumi','Add gradient'=>'Ƙara gradient','Glass'=>'Gilashi','Mask'=>'Masko','Filters'=>'Matattara','Wave'=>'Wave','Waves'=>'Waves','Curve'=>'Kankara','Curve (asymmetric)'=>'Curve (asymmetric)','Arc'=>'Baka','Tilt'=>'Karkata','Tilt (layered)'=>'Karkata (ma da yawa)','Triangle (asymmetric)'=>'Uku-uku (wanda ba ya daidaita)','Split'=>'Raba','Zigzag'=>'Zigzag','Mountains'=>'Dutse','Clouds'=>'Gajimare','Drops'=>'Saukarwa','Pyramids'=>'Pyramids','Book'=>'Yi Ajiya','Stairs'=>'Matakala','Fan'=>'Magoya baya','Height (px)'=>'Tsayi (px)','Mirror'=>'Madubi','Invert'=>'Juya','In front of the content'=>'Gaban abubuwan dake ciki','Source'=>'Maɓalli','Video file (MP4 / WebM)'=>'Fayil din bidiyo (MP4 / WebM)','Choose MP4 or WebM video'=>'Zaɓi bidiyon MP4 ko WebM','MP4 address'=>'Adireshin MP4','WebM address'=>'Adireshin WebM','YouTube video ID (11 characters)'=>'ID na bidiyon YouTube (haruffa 11)','Vimeo video number'=>'Lambar bidiyon Vimeo','Visitors only contact the video service when they scroll to this section, and never when their device asks for reduced motion. Until then they see the poster image.'=>'Baƙi na tuntuɓar sabis na bidiyo ne kawai lokacin da suka gungura zuwa wannan sashin, kuma ba a taɓa yin hakan ba lokacin da na\'urarsu ta nemi raguwar motsi. Har zuwa lokacin suna ganin hoton faston.','Replace poster image'=>'Maye gurbin hoton mai tallatawa','Choose poster image'=>'Zaɓi hoton bango','Background slideshow'=>'Hoton bango na kallo mai jujjuyawa','Change images'=>'Canza hotuna','Choose images'=>'Zaɓi hotuna','Choose at least two images.'=>'Zaɓi aƙalla hotuna biyu.','Seconds per image'=>'Sekon kowace hoto','Fade'=>'Fara dusashewa','Slide'=>'Zazzage','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Jinkiri a hankali (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Cire hotunan nuni','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Masu ziyara da suka roƙi na\'urarsu da ta rage motsi suna ganin hoto na farko kawai.','Section effects'=>'Tasirin sashe','Top divider'=>'Babban mai raba abun ciki','Bottom divider'=>'Rabona ta kasa','Choose the logo'=>'Zabi tambarin','Not set'=>'Ba a saita ba','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Bincika launukan alamar: kowanne yana buƙatar suna na musamman da kuma ingantaccen launi.','Brand name'=>'Sunan alamar kasuwanci','Replace logo'=>'Maye gurbin tambari','Choose logo'=>'Zabi tambari','A logo is chosen.'=>'An zaɓi tambari.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Zaɓi tambarin daga shafin Tsarin Yanar Gizo.','Remove logo'=>'Cire tambari','Brand colours'=>'Launin alama','Remove %s'=>'Cire %s','Brand %d'=>'Alamar %d','Add brand colour'=>'Ƙara launin alama','Heading font'=>'Font din jigo','Body font'=>'Rubutun jiki','Tone of voice'=>'Salon murya','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Yadda alamarku ke rubutu, misali "Abokantaka da sauƙi, gajerun jimloli, ba tare da ƙwarewa mai rikitarwa ba." AI na bin shi a duk lokacin da yake rubuta wa wannan shafin.','Brand kit saved.'=>'An adana kayan aikin alama.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'An yi amfani da alamar kasuwanci: launukanta, rubutunta da tambarinta yanzu sun zama na shafin.','Apply to site'=>'Afa da shafi','All classes'=>'Duk azuzuwan','Class name on the page'=>'Sunan ajji a shafin','Printed as %s.'=>'An buga a matsayin %s.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Fara da harafi; kananan haruffa, lambobi da manyan layuka kawai.','Styles'=>'Salonki','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Ba a loda sarrafa salon ba. Sake loda shafin; idan hakan ta ci gaba, sake shigar da plugin ɗin.','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'An ajiye ajin. Kowane bangare da ke amfani da shi yana da sabon salon.','Save class'=>'Ajiye aji','Class created.'=>'An halicci ajin.','New class'=>'Sabon aji','e.g. Card'=>'misali Katin','Create'=>'Ƙirƙira','Search classes'=>'Bincike ajujuwa','No class matches.'=>'Babu ajin da ya dace.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Babu azuzuwa tukuna. Ka ƙirƙiri ɗaya, ka tsara shi, sannan ka ƙara shi ga kowane abu daga saitunansa.','Edit %s'=>'Gyara %s','Duplicate %s'=>'Kwafi %s','Class duplicated.'=>'An kwafi ajin.','Delete %s'=>'Goge %s','Class deleted.'=>'An cire ajujuwa.','Delete'=>'Goge','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Soke ajin "%s"? Abubuwan da ke amfani da shi za su riƙe abubuwansu su rasa salonsu.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Masu amfani kawai da za su iya ƙara HTML da ba a taƙaita ba ne za su iya Canza CSS na musamman.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Wasu daga cikin wannan CSS ɗin ba za a yi amfani da su ba: An cire @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, da "<" da kuma maƙallan da ba su da daidaito don dalilan tsaro.','Upload a font'=>'Loda wani font','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Loda fonte yana buƙatar WordPress 6.5 ko kuma wanda ya fi haka.','Font name'=>'Sunan harafi','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'misali Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'An loda %s kuma yana shirye don amfani.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Zaɓi fayil ɗin rubutu (%s)','Font library'=>'Laburaren haruffa','%d files'=>'fayiloli %d','Font switched off for the site.'=>'An kashe rubutun ga rukunin yanar gizon.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'An kunna rubutu don shafin.','Switch off'=>'Kashe','Switch on'=>'Kunna','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Saka lambar kit din aikin Adobe Fonts na yanar gizo. Sannan a loda font ɗinsa daga Adobe a shafukanka.','Your web projects'=>'Ayyukan gidan yanar gizonku','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'An haɗa Adobe Fonts.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'An cire Adobe Fonts.','Kit id'=>'ID ɗin kayan aiki','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'Kasar duhu na "%s" ba ta da inganci launin gaske.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Lokacin da ba a zaɓi baƙo','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Bi na\'urar mai ziyara','Light'=>'Haske','Dark'=>'Duhu','Dark colours'=>'Launin duhu','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Ba kowane launi sigarsa ta duhu ba. Launukan da aka bari babu komai za su kasance iri ɗaya a jeri biyu. Yanayin duhu yana aiki da zaran launi ɗaya ya sami ƙimar duhu.','Dark version of %s'=>'Sigar duhu ta %s','Dark mode saved.'=>'An adana yanayin duhu.','Page CSS'=>'Shafin CSS','Global classes'=>'Azuzu na duniya gaba ɗaya','Classes'=>'Azuzu','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Ƙirƙiri azuzuwa a cikin Tsarin shafin, sannan ka ƙara su anan.','Custom CSS'=>'CSS na Musamman','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'Rubuta dokoki don wannan abin. "selector" yana nufin wannan abin, misali selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — bayyanannun sanarwa suna aiki ne akan abin da kansa.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Dole fayilolin rubutu su kasance %s.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin rubutun babu komai a ciki ko kuma ya fi MB 10.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Sanya salon sau ɗaya, sake amfani da shi ko\'ina, ka canza a wuri guda.','Variables'=>'Canje-canje','Named values any element can use.'=>'Ƙimar da aka sanya wa suna wadda kowane abu zai iya amfani da ita.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Ratse, da\'ira da inuwa','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Ma\'aunin da kowane zabin sarari, kusurwa da inuwa ke bayarwa.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Wani sigar launukanka mai duhu, ga baƙi masu son shi.','Brand kit'=>'Kayan lakabi na alama','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Alamar, launi, haruffa da sautin murci, waɗanda AI da samfura ke amfani da su.','Custom fonts'=>'Fontoci na Musamman','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'Sanya naka rubutun ko kuma ka haɗa da Adobe Fonts.','CSS for this page only.'=>'CSS don ga wannan shafin kawai.','CSS for this page'=>'CSS don wannan shafi','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'An loda shi a kan wannan shafi kawai, bayan salon rukunin yanar gizon. An adana shi tare da shafin.','Short name'=>'Takaitaccen suna','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'An gajeren sunan "%s" an yi amfani da shi sau biyu.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": gajerun sunaye suna amfani da kananan haruffa, lambobi da kuma Alamomin raba kalmomi.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'Darajar "%s" ba ta kasance ɗaya daga cikin waɗanda wannan saitin ke karɓa ba.','Radius'=>'Radius','Add a step'=>'Ƙara mataki daya','Scales saved.'=>'An adana sikelin.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'An koma da sikelin zuwa tsoffin tsarin.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Sake saiti zuwa ma\'auni na asali','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Babu ma\'auni tukuna. Ma\'auni yana riƙe da ƙima guda ɗaya — faɗi, cakuda launi, girmansa — wanda abubuwa da yawa ke rabawa.','Add variable'=>'Ƙara maɓalli','Variables saved.'=>'An adana sauye-sauye.','No colours yet.'=>'Babu launuka tukuna.','Colour %d'=>'Launi %d','Add colour'=>'Ƙara launi','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Launi biyu suna da sunan iri ɗaya. Sake wa ɗaya suna.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" ba launi ne mai inganci ba.','Theme colours'=>'Launukan jigo','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Falettar jigon ku. Canji a nan ana adana shi azaman sigar rini ta shafin ku, ta daidai yadda Editan Shafin ke adana shi, kuma yana aiki a ko\'ina inda aka yi amfani da rinin.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Launi na jigo sun koma ga kansa na jigo.','Reset theme colours'=>'Sake saitin launukan jigo','Your colours'=>'Launukanka','Colours saved.'=>'An adana launuka.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'Zaɓi launi don %s','Clear'=>'Sharege','The change could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana sauyi ba.','Close panel'=>'Rufe kwamitin','Theme default'=>'An tsoffin jigo','Theme fonts'=>'Fontunan jigo','Your fonts'=>'Rubutunka na asali','Font stack'=>'Jerin haruffa','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Font da aka loda: fayilolinsa sun fito ne daga ɗakin karatu na font.','System sans-serif'=>'Tsarin sans-serif','Add font stack'=>'Ƙara tarin font','Fonts saved.'=>'An adana rubutun.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'An raba shi da jigon ku da Editan Shafin.','Fonts'=>'Fontuna','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Rubutun shugaba da na jiki ga dukan shafin yanar gizon.','Back to Site design'=>'Komawa zuwa Tsarin shafin','Pro'=>'Pro','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Aji, alamomi, yanayin duhu, kayan aikin alama da rubutun hannu na musamman sun zo tare da Pro','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Buɗe salon Editan Shafin','Heading'=>'Taken kai','Plain'=>'Na yau da kullum','Accent'=>'Harshe','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Babu harsunan da za a iya canzawa tsakaninsu. Maɓallin canza harshe yana bayyana ne lokacin da wani kari na fassara ya lissafa harsuna biyu ko fiye.','Switcher'=>'Mai canzawa','Show the current language'=>'Nuna harshen da ake ciki yanzu','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Shigar da Tranzly kuma ka sanya jerin harsuna biyu ko fiye, kuma za a nuna mai canza harshen anan.','List'=>'Jereni','Pills'=>'Kwayoyi','Buttons'=>'Maɓallai','Dropdown'=>'Menu mai sauka','Language codes'=>'Lambar Harsuna','Show each language as'=>'Nuna kowane harshe a matsayin','Language name'=>'Sunan harshe','Language code'=>'Lamba harshe','Name and code'=>'Suna da lamba','Flags'=>'Alamar saƙo','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'A kashe yake a asali: tuta kasa ce, ba harshe ba.','Include the current language'=>'Haɗa da harshen yanzu','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Boye da harsunan da ba a fassara wannan shafin zuwa gare su ba','Stack vertically'=>'Ajiye a tsaye','Background'=>'Bayan Fage','Current language text'=>'Harshen da ake ciki a yanzu','Current language background'=>'Bayanin yaren da ake ciki a yanzu','Size and spacing'=>'Girma da tazara','Space between languages'=>'Sarari tsakanin harsuna','Text size'=>'Girman rubutu','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s yana gyara wannan shafin kuma. Ajiye zai iya rubuta a kan gyare-gyarensa.','Block library'=>'Laburaren buloka','Layers'=>'Taruka','Page canvas'=>'Filin shafi','Revisions'=>'Gyare-gyare','Block settings'=>'Saitunan katange','Add block: %s'=>'Ƙara tubali: %s','(no title)'=>'(babu lakabi)','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Buɗe a Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Sake dawo da shi','Redo'=>'Sake yi','Show or hide layers'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye yadudduka','Show or hide the block library'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye ɗakin karatu na bulolin','Show revisions'=>'Nuna gyare-gyare','Open the normal editor'=>'Buɗe edita na al\'ada','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Gajerun hanyoyin madannai','Preview: desktop'=>'Dubawa: kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka','Preview: tablet'=>'Dubawa: kwamfutar hannu','Preview: mobile'=>'Gani a wayar hannu:','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Kwafi salin zababben tubalin','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Liya sanyin salon a kan zababben tubalin','Copy the selected section'=>'Kwafi sashin da aka zaɓa','Paste a copied section'=>'Liƙa sashen da aka kwafi','Turn off safe mode'=>'Kashe yanayin aminci','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Kunna yanayin aminci (sauran ɗorawa a kashe, a gare ka, a Studio kaɗai)','Published'=>'An buga','Scheduled'=>'An tsara','Pending review'=>'Ana jiran dubawa','Private'=>'Maigirma','Draft'=>'Da-aka-tsara','All changes saved'=>'An adana duk sauye-sauye','Saving…'=>'Ana adanawa...','Autosaving…'=>'Ana adanawa ta atomatik…','Unsaved changes'=>'Canjin da ba a ajiyewa ba','autosaved'=>'an adana ta atomatik','Desktop preview'=>'Samfurin kwamfuta ta tebur','Tablet preview'=>'Dubawar kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka','Mobile preview'=>'Duban wayar hannu','%1$s preview (%2$d px)'=>'Misalin %1$s (%2$d px)','Studio toolbar'=>'Sandar kayan aiki ta Studio','Back to the normal editor'=>'Koma zuwa edita na al\'ada','Page title'=>'Sunan shafi','Preview width'=>'Fadin samfoti','Command palette'=>'Kundin umarni','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Duba shafi (yana buɗe a cikin sabon shafi)','Save draft'=>'Ajiye daftari','Publish'=>'Bugawa','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Sake dawo da canjin da ba a ajiyee ba?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Wannan shafin yana da canje-canjen da ba a taba adana su ba. An kiyaye su a cikin wannan burauz din:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Wannan shafin yana da sabon kwafin da aka adana ta atomatik fiye da sigar da aka adana:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Mayar da canje-canjen da ba a ajiyewa ba','Discard'=>'Kora da shi','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Ba a iya loda gyare-gyaren ba.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'An dawo da fasalin da aka gyara. Ajiye don riƙe shi, ko a soke don komawa baya.','Close revisions'=>'Rufe bita','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Ba a yi gyare-gyare ba tukuna. Kowace adanawa tana ƙirƙirar ɗaya.','Revision from %s'=>'Revision daga %s','Restore this revision'=>'Maido da wannan bita','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'Ba aweza canza yanayin aminci ba.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Yanayin tsaro yana kunne.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'An kashe wani plug-in %d daban, domin ku kadai kuma a cikin Sandwich Studio kadai. Wannan ba zai shafi raddadin rukunin yanar gizo na gaske da sauran masu amfani ba.' . "\0" . 'Wasu plugins %d an kashe su, domin ku da kuma a Sandwich Studio kadai. Ba a shafar shafin da ke aiki da sauran masu amfani ba.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Yanayin lafiya: kashe sauranfulojoji a cikin Studio, don ku kadai','Safe mode'=>'Yanayin tsaro','Save your changes.'=>'Ajiye canje-canjenku.','Undo your last change.'=>'Sake dawo da sauye-kayenku na ƙarshe.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Maimaita abin da ka soke na karshe.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye kwamitin yadudduka.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Nuna waɗannan gajerun hanyoyin madannai.','Select a block first.'=>'Zaɓi buloka tukuna.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'An kwafi salon. Manna shi a kan kowane buloku, a kan wannan shafin ko wani.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Mai binciken ya ki kwafi.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'An kwafi sashen. Manna shi a kowane shafi, a wannan shafin ko wani.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Ba a adana salon da aka kwafi daga Sandwich Studio a cikin allo ba.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Salon da aka manna a kan tubali %d.' . "\0" . 'An shafa salo a kan tubalan %d.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Wannan salon bai dace da katangar da aka zaɓa ba.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Allon kwafi ba shi da wani yanki da aka kwafa.','Section pasted.'=>'An manna da aka liƙa.','Paste style'=>'Manna salon salo','Paste section'=>'Manna sashe','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Latsa Ctrl+V (ko Cmd+V a kan Mac) anan don mannawa','Copy style'=>'Kofe salo','Copy section'=>'Kwafi sashin','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Gyara a cikin Sandwich Studio','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'An adana ba ta yi nasara ba. Duba hanyar sadarwarku kuma ku sake gwadawa; an kiyaye sauye-sauyenkanku a cikin wannan burauz din.','Published.'=>'An buga','Saved.'=>'An adana.','Maintenance and pre-launch mode'=>'Kulawa da yanayin kafin kaddamarwa','What visitors see'=>'Abin da baƙi ke gani','The site, as normal'=>'Yanar gizo, kamar yadda yake a yanzu','Maintenance: a notice, and search engines are told to come back later'=>'Gyara: sanarwa, kuma an gaya wa injunan bincike su dawo daga baya','Pre-launch: a notice, and search engines are told not to index the site'=>'Kafin ƙaddamarwa: sanarwa, kuma an gaya wa injunan bincike kada su sanya shafin a cikin lissafin su','Page to show instead'=>'Shafin da za a nuna a maimakon haka','Design any page with the builder and choose it here. Without one, visitors see a short notice with the site’s name.'=>'Tsara kowane shafi tare da mai ginawa kuma ka zaba shi anan. Ba tare da shi ba, baƙi za su ga ɗan sanarwa tare da sunan shafin yanar gizon.','Who still sees the real site (administrators always do):'=>'Wane ne har yanzu yake ganin ainihin shafin (masu gudanarwa koyaushe suna ganinsa):','Open the site in a private window to see what visitors see.'=>'Buɗe rukunin yanar gizon a cikin taga mai zaman kansa don ganin abin da baƙi ke gani.','Network settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan hanyar sadarwa.','These settings apply to the %d site in this network.'=>'Wadannan saitunan suna a aiki ga shafin %d a cikin wannan hanyar sadarwa.' . "\0" . 'Wadannan saitunan suna a shafuka %d da ke cikin wannan hanyar sadarwa.','Shared templates'=>'Samfuran da aka raba','Patterns saved on the main site that are ticked here appear on every site, under “Network templates”. Each site inserts its own copy.'=>'Tsarin da aka adana a babban sahit ɗin da aka yi wa alama a nan suna bayyana a kowane sahit, ƙarƙashin “Network templates”. Kowane sahit yana sanya nasa kofi.','The main site has no saved patterns yet.'=>'Babban rukunin yanar gizon ba shi da tsarin da aka adana tukuna.','White label for every site'=>'Farar alama ga kowane shafi','Used by every site that has not saved its own white-label settings.'=>'Kowace shafin da bai adana nasa saitunan alamar fari ba yana amfani da shi.','Turn white label on'=>'Kunna alamar farar fata','Builder name'=>'Sunan mai ginawa','Visual editor name'=>'Sunan editan gani','Author'=>'Marubuci','Author website'=>'Shafin marubuci','Menu icon'=>'Alamar menu','Role defaults for every site'=>'Matsakaicin matsayi na kowace shafi','Save network settings'=>'Ajiye saitunan hanyar sadarwa','Searching… %d item checked so far.'=>'Ana bincike... An duba abu %d kawo yanzu.' . "\0" . 'Ana bincike… Abubuwa %d aka duba kawo yanzu.','No matches in %d items. Nothing to replace.'=>'Ba a sami sakamako a cikin abubuwa %d ba. Babu abin da za a maye gurbinsa.','%1$d matches on %2$d pages (%3$d items searched). Nothing has changed yet.'=>'Wasanni %1$d a shafuka %2$d (an bincika abubuwa %3$d). Babu wani abu da ya canza tukuna.','Replacing… %1$d of %2$d pages done.'=>'Ana maye gurbi… An kammala shafuka %1$d cikin %2$d.','Done: %d page changed. You can undo this.'=>'An gama: An canza shafi %d. Kuna iya juya wannan baya.' . "\0" . 'An gama: shafuka %d sun canza. Kuna iya soke wannan.','Undoing…'=>'Ana soke wa...','Undone: %1$d pages restored. %2$d pages were edited after the replacement and were left as they are.'=>'Ba a yi ba: An dawo da shafuka %1$d. An gyara shafuka %2$d bayan maye gurbin kuma an bar su kamar yadda suke.','Undone: %d page restored.'=>'An cire: An dawo da shafi %d.' . "\0" . 'Ba a yi ba: An dawo da shafuka %d.','Find and replace across all pages'=>'Nemo kuma a maye gurbinsu a duk shafuka','Replace'=>'Maye gurbi','Links'=>'Hanyoyin haɗi','Find'=>'Nemo','A hex colour such as #1a73e8. Short forms (#fff) match too.'=>'Wani launi na hex kamar #1a73e8. Gajerun sigogi (#fff) ma sun dace.','Replace with'=>'Canza da','Match upper and lower case'=>'Daidaita babban bakin rubutu da ƙarami','Search in'=>'Bincika a cikin','Find matches'=>'Nemo daidaito','Page'=>'Shafi','Matches'=>'Wadanda Suka Dace','Previous'=>'Na baya','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Shafi %1$d na %2$d','Replace on %d page'=>'Maye gurbi a shafi na %d' . "\0" . 'Maye gurbi a shafuka %d','Undo this replacement'=>'Mayar da wannan sauye-sauyen','Review comments'=>'Sake bita','Add a comment'=>'Ƙara sharhi','Comment %1$d by %2$s: %3$s'=>'Sharhi %1$d daga %2$s: %3$s','%d comments on this page.'=>'Sharhi %d a wannan shafin.','Your name'=>'Sunanka','Your comment'=>'Sharhinku','Send comment'=>'Aiko da tsokaci','Thank you, your comment was sent.'=>'Na gode, an aika da ra\'ayin ku.