e settings'=>'Ajiye saitunan rawa','Saved. Reload the page to see the new names.'=>'An adana shi. Sake lodi shafin don ganin sabon sunayen.','White label'=>'Alamar farar takarda','Rename the builder and hide our branding on this site'=>'Sake waƙar ginin kuma ɓoye alamar kasuwancinmu a kan wannan shafin','Shown everywhere the product name appears: menus, the editor, notices.'=>'An nuna a ko\'ina inda sunan samfurin ya bayyana: menus, edita, da sanarwa.','Leave empty to use the builder name.'=>'Bar a fanko domin amfani da sunan mai ginin shafi.','Description on the Plugins screen'=>'Bayani akan allon Ƙarin Bayani (Plugins)','A Dashicons name (for example dashicons-admin-customizer) or an https:// image address.'=>'Sunan Dashicons (misali dashicons-admin-customizer) ko adireshin hoto na https://.','Hide the plugin from the Plugins screen'=>'Boyie da ƙarin a kan allon Ƙara masa aiki (Plugins)','Agency users who still see the real product and these settings'=>'Masu amfani da kamfani wadanda har yanzu suke ganin ainihin samfurin da waɗannan saitunan','%d new'=>'sababbi %d' . "\0" . 'sababbi %d','%d replaced'=>'An canja %d' . "\0" . 'An canja %d','%d kept as they were'=>'%d an adana su yadda suke' . "\0" . '%d an adana su yadda suke','%d setting'=>'saituna %d' . "\0" . 'saituna %d','Importing will give: %s.'=>'Shigo da kaya zai ba da: %s.','Imported: %s.'=>'An shigo da shi: %s.','Exported %d item.'=>'An fitar da abu %d.' . "\0" . 'An fitar da abubuwa %d.','That file could not be read as an export file.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin a matsayin fayil na fitarwa ba.','Import and export'=>'Shigo da fitar da su','Export'=>'Fitar da kaya','Download your templates, patterns and site design as one file, to import on another site.'=>'Sauke samfuran ku, tsare-tsare da zanen shafin ku a matsayin fayil ɗaya, don shigo da su a wani shafin.','There are no templates or patterns to export yet.'=>'Babu samfura ko tsari da za a fitar a yanzu.','Include the settings'=>'Haɗa da saitunan','Download the export file'=>'Sauke fayil ɗin fitarwa','Import'=>'Shigo da shi','Choose an export file'=>'Zaɓi fayil ɗin fitarwa','The file holds %1$d item from %2$s.'=>'Fayil ɗin ya ƙunshi abu %1$d daga %2$s.' . "\0" . 'Fayil ɗin yana dauke da abubuwa %1$d daga %2$s.','When an item with the same name already exists here'=>'Lokacin da wani abu mai suna iri ɗaya ya riga ya kasance a nan','Keep the one on this site'=>'Ajiye wanda ke kan wannan shafin','Replace it with the imported one'=>'Sauya shi da wanda aka shigo da shi','Import a copy beside it'=>'Shigo da kwafi kusa da shi','Apply the settings in the file'=>'Afa saitunan da ke cikin fayil ɗin','Copy the images into this site’s media library'=>'Kwafi hotunan zuwa cikin ɗakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai na wannan shafin','Show what will happen'=>'Nuna abin da zai faru','block titleAlert'=>'Sanarwa','block descriptionA notice for your visitors: information, success, a warning or an error, with an optional title and a close button.'=>'Sanarwa ga baƙon ku: bayani, nasara, gargaɗi ko kuskure, tare da zaɓaɓɓen take da maɓallin rufewa.','block keywordnotice'=>'sanarwa','block keywordmessage'=>'sako','block keywordcallout'=>'sanarwa','block keywordwarning'=>'gargaɗi','block titleButton link'=>'Mahadar maɓalli','block descriptionA link styled as a button.'=>'Hanyar haɗi mai salo kamar maɓalli.','block keywordbutton'=>'mabuɗi','block keywordlink'=>'mahada','block keywordcall to action'=>'kira zuwa ga aiki','block titleColumn'=>'Shafi\'i','block descriptionA column inside a row. It can hold any block.'=>'Wani shafi a cikin jere. Yana iya ɗaukar kowane buloka.','block keywordcolumn'=>'shafi','block keywordlayout'=>'tsari','block titleContainer'=>'Kwati','block descriptionA box that lays out the blocks inside it with flexbox or a grid. Nest containers to build any layout. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Wani akwati da ke tsara tubalan da ke cikinsa tare da flexbox ko grid. Sanya kwantena a cikin juna don gina kowane tsari. Yana ci gaba da kasancewa mai karatu idan har aka kashe ɗan tazarar (plugin).','block keywordcontainer'=>'kontena','block keywordbox'=>'akwati','block keywordgrid'=>'gidaje','block keywordflexbox'=>'flexbox','block keywordcolumns'=>'shafiuka','block titleLanguage switcher (sample)'=>'Mai sauya harshe (misali)','block descriptionLists the site\'s languages from the translation plugin, when one is active. It renders nothing otherwise.'=>'Ana lissafa harsunan shafin daga matosai na fassara, idan akwai mai aiki. Ba ya nuna komai in ba haka ba.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Harshe','block keywordswitcher'=>'mai sauyawa','block titleSample content'=>'Samfurin abun ciki','block descriptionA heading and a paragraph, rendered with neutral class names. It is the reference block for the translation contract.'=>'Wani take da sakin layi, waɗanda aka nuna da sunayen aji marasa ɓata guda. Shi ne tubalin misali don kwangilar fassara.','block keywordsample'=>'misali','block keywordtext'=>'rubutu','block titleIcon'=>'Alama','block descriptionAn SVG icon. The markup is cleaned before it is shown.'=>'Alamar SVG. An tsabtace lambar kafin a nuna ta.','block keywordicon'=>'gunkadi','block keywordsvg'=>'svg','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Mai sauya harshe','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another language, styled to match your page. Needs the Tranzly plugin for the languages.'=>'Bar wa baƙi damar karanta wannan shafi a wani harshe, wanda aka tsara ya dace da shafinka. Yana buƙatar to ɗin Tranzly don harsunan.','block keywordtranslation'=>'fassarar','block keywordmultilingual'=>'mai harsuna da yawa','block titleDark mode switch'=>'Canjin yanayin duhu','block descriptionA button that switches the website between its light and dark colours, and remembers the visitor\'s choice.'=>'Wani maɓalli da ke canza gidan yanar gizo tsakanin launukansa na haske da duhu, kuma yana tuna zaɓin baƙon.','block keyworddark'=>'duhu','block keywordlight'=>'haske','block keywordcolour scheme'=>'launin tsari','block titleRow'=>'Jergi','block descriptionA row of columns. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Jerin shafuka. Zai ci gaba da karatu idan an kashe fasalin.','block keywordrow'=>'layla','block titleSection'=>'Sashe','block descriptionA full-width band of the page that lays its content out with flexbox or a grid. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Wani yanki mai faɗin shafi wanda ke tsara abubuwansa ta amfani da flexbox ko grid. Yana kasancewa mai karatu idan har an kashe plugin ɗin.','block keywordsection'=>'Sashe','block titleShortcode (add-on)'=>'Shortcode (add-on)','block descriptionA shortcode from an add-on written for the classic Page Builder Sandwich editor, with the settings the add-on declared.'=>'Gajeren lambar daga wani kari da aka rubuta don tsohon editan Page Builder Sandwich, tare da saitunan da karin ya bayyana.','block keywordshortcode'=>'gajerun lambobi','block keywordadd-on'=>'ƙari','block titleWidget area'=>'Yankin Widget','block descriptionShows the widgets in one of the theme\'s widget areas.'=>'Yana nuna widgets a cikin ɗayan wuraren widget na jigon.','block keywordsidebar'=>'ashar gefe','block keywordwidget area'=>'yankin widget','block titleWidget'=>'Widget','block descriptionShows one of the site\'s registered classic widgets.'=>'Yana nuna ɗaya daga cikin tsofaffin widgets ɗin da aka yi wa rajista na shafin.','block keywordwidget'=>'widget']];